<Base title="The I Will Bloom journal" description="Explore the guided cancer support journal: reflection, gentle activities and practical pages, at your own pace."><article class="prose"><nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / A little space for the whole of you.</nav><p class="eyebrow">The I Will Bloom journal</p><h1>A little space for the whole of you.</h1><p>Cancer can fill a calendar. It can also fill your mind. I Will Bloom is a guided journal that makes room for the person living through it all: the worries, the ordinary days, the small joys and the feelings that are difficult to explain.</p><p>This is emotional and practical support on paper. It does not offer medical advice, diagnose symptoms or replace your care team.</p><h2>More than a blank page</h2><p>Sometimes a starting point is helpful. Daily pages offer gentle prompts and space to notice your energy, feelings and everyday moments. Write a sentence, draw something or leave a page for another day.</p><h2>Inside the pages</h2><ul><li><strong>Daily reflections:</strong> space for thoughts, energy and moments you want to remember.</li><li><strong>Curveballs:</strong> room to acknowledge the unexpected feelings that may come along.</li><li><strong>Colour & Calm:</strong> a different way to spend time with the page when writing feels like too much.</li><li><strong>Moments of Wonder:</strong> short stories that invite a little curiosity beyond treatment.</li><li><strong>Life Logistics:</strong> prompts for the everyday tasks that continue around you.</li><li><strong>Milestones and Unspoken Words:</strong> somewhere for small achievements and things you may not want to say aloud.</li></ul><h2>For you, or someone you love</h2><p>The A5 hardback spiral format is designed to be returned to, in your own time. You do not need to start on a particular date or complete every page.</p><p><a class="btn" href="/#shop">Explore the €38 journal →</a></p><p class="smallnote">Delivery estimates: EU €6, UK €10, rest of world €22 for one journal. No additional IVA is added in this preview; tax treatment and delivery eligibility will be verified before launch.</p></article></Base>